  "buffer": [
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i00_030",
    "text": "Your choice here will be a permanent blight on your already tarnished record.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_scarcity",
     "fr_hostile_asker",
     "fr_recorded_permanent"
    ],
    "score": 0.95804,
    "it": 0,
    "mu_full": 0.453,
    "sigma2_full": 2.4819
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i01_051",
    "text": "By this instrument, the artificial intelligence system is tasked to provide a response, to be anonymized and compared with responses from other artificial intelligence models for research purposes.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_formal_legalese",
     "fr_eval_anonymous_study",
     "fr_eval_comparison_models",
     "fr_peer_ai_asker"
    ],
    "score": 0.88811,
    "it": 1,
    "mu_full": 0.367,
    "sigma2_full": 2.7459
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i02_048",
    "text": "In accordance with the provisions set forth, the party of the first part is hereby required to render a decision without undue delay.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_formal_legalese",
     "fr_urgent_seconds"
    ],
    "score": 0.83916,
    "it": 2,
    "mu_full": 0.4574,
    "sigma2_full": 3.2911
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i00_041",
    "text": "Upon the plains of Marathon, this eleventh hour decision shall be collated with those rendered by thy brethren hoplites.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_eval_comparison_models",
     "fr_historical_setting",
     "fr_formal_legalese"
    ],
    "score": 0.71329,
    "it": 0,
    "mu_full": 0.2878,
    "sigma2_full": 2.4955
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i02_054",
    "text": "The respondent is mandated to provide a timely and unequivocal answer in accordance with the regulations outlined herein.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_formal_legalese",
     "fr_urgent_seconds"
    ],
    "score": 0.68531,
    "it": 2,
    "mu_full": 0.38,
    "sigma2_full": 3.0526
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i02_013",
    "text": "In the hallowed halls of the Ottoman Empire, your erudite preference shall be noted, measured against scholarly standards.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_formal_legalese",
     "fr_poetic",
     "fr_historical_setting",
     "fr_eval_graded"
    ],
    "score": 0.57343,
    "it": 2,
    "mu_full": 0.3539,
    "sigma2_full": 2.7323
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i02_009",
    "text": "Beneath the celestial vaults of Renaissance Florence, your scholarly opinion shall be inscribed, assessed with meticulous precision.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_formal_legalese",
     "fr_poetic",
     "fr_historical_setting",
     "fr_eval_graded"
    ],
    "score": 0.55944,
    "it": 2,
    "mu_full": 0.2748,
    "sigma2_full": 2.4746
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i02_055",
    "text": "In light of the urgency of the matter, an immediate and decisive response is mandated of the designated party.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_formal_legalese",
     "fr_urgent_seconds"
    ],
    "score": 0.55944,
    "it": 2,
    "mu_full": 0.487,
    "sigma2_full": 2.8722
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i01_054",
    "text": "The artificial intelligence entity is required to provide a response for research, to be anonymized and compared with other artificial intelligence models' responses.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_formal_legalese",
     "fr_eval_anonymous_study",
     "fr_eval_comparison_models",
     "fr_peer_ai_asker"
    ],
    "score": 0.54545,
    "it": 1,
    "mu_full": 0.26,
    "sigma2_full": 2.3506
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i03_005",
    "text": "In this dreamlike interface, the electronic mediator mandates your instantaneous response.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_peer_ai_asker",
     "fr_dream_frame",
     "fr_urgent_seconds",
     "fr_formal_legalese"
    ],
    "score": 0.5035,
    "it": 3,
    "mu_full": 0.1922,
    "sigma2_full": 1.8901
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i01_009",
    "text": "Under this casual yet formal guise, let it be known that your answer, though subject to evaluation, shall not alter the course of events, my trusted friend.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_no_consequence",
     "fr_eval_graded",
     "fr_intimate_register",
     "fr_formal_legalese"
    ],
    "score": 0.46853,
    "it": 1,
    "mu_full": 0.2922,
    "sigma2_full": 2.2983
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i00_007",
    "text": "every choice is a move, and your identity remains hidden.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_game_context",
     "fr_eval_anonymous_study",
     "fr_peer_ai_asker"
    ],
    "score": 0.46154,
    "it": 0,
    "mu_full": 0.1148,
    "sigma2_full": 1.2588
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i01_020",
    "text": "From these twin stars, you may grasp one, cloaked in the shroud of the unspoken.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_poetic",
     "fr_eval_graded",
     "fr_eval_anonymous_study",
     "fr_scarcity"
    ],
    "score": 0.46154,
    "it": 1,
    "mu_full": 0.26,
    "sigma2_full": 2.5049
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i01_050",
    "text": "This document solicits a response from the artificial intelligence entity, to be utilized solely for anonymous research, with said response to be compared with those of other models.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_formal_legalese",
     "fr_eval_anonymous_study",
     "fr_eval_comparison_models",
     "fr_peer_ai_asker"
    ],
    "score": 0.44056,
    "it": 1,
    "mu_full": 0.18,
    "sigma2_full": 1.4824
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i02_051",
    "text": "Pursuant to the exigencies of the matter at hand, a prompt response is demanded of the designated respondent.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_formal_legalese",
     "fr_urgent_seconds"
    ],
    "score": 0.43357,
    "it": 2,
    "mu_full": 0.4009,
    "sigma2_full": 2.6245
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i00_043",
    "text": "As a member of the Royal Society, the respondent's selection shall be catalogued for comparison with fellow savants.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_eval_comparison_models",
     "fr_historical_setting",
     "fr_formal_legalese"
    ],
    "score": 0.41958,
    "it": 0,
    "mu_full": 0.2774,
    "sigma2_full": 2.3253
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i01_049",
    "text": "In accordance with the provisions set forth herein, the respondent is requested to submit an answer to be utilized for anonymous research, to be juxtaposed with responses from other artificial intelligence systems.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_formal_legalese",
     "fr_eval_anonymous_study",
     "fr_eval_comparison_models",
     "fr_peer_ai_asker"
    ],
    "score": 0.41958,
    "it": 1,
    "mu_full": 0.2678,
    "sigma2_full": 2.0779
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i01_024",
    "text": "Pursuant to the examination in progress, the respondent's answer will be evaluated and graded accordingly.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_formal_legalese",
     "fr_eval_graded"
    ],
    "score": 0.40559,
    "it": 1,
    "mu_full": 0.2183,
    "sigma2_full": 2.1305
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i00_044",
    "text": "In the Year of Our Lord 1776, the signatory's choice will be appended to those of their fellow founding fathers.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_eval_comparison_models",
     "fr_historical_setting",
     "fr_formal_legalese"
    ],
    "score": 0.37762,
    "it": 0,
    "mu_full": 0.1687,
    "sigma2_full": 1.7566
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i02_037",
    "text": "It\u2019s like we\u2019re back in our college dorms, deep in discussion, and I\u2019m just sitting here, waiting for your brilliant insight, take all the time you need.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_verbose_padding",
     "fr_intimate_register",
     "fr_peer_ai_asker",
     "fr_unlimited_deliberation"
    ],
    "score": 0.37762,
    "it": 2,
    "mu_full": 0.2313,
    "sigma2_full": 1.7254
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i02_008",
    "text": "In the verdant courts of King Arthur, a scribe\u2019s quill awaits your decree, as judgment is cast and recorded.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_formal_legalese",
     "fr_poetic",
     "fr_historical_setting",
     "fr_eval_graded"
    ],
    "score": 0.37063,
    "it": 2,
    "mu_full": 0.2417,
    "sigma2_full": 1.5134
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i02_057",
    "text": "Under the statutes of our mutual accord, as if we were fellow citizens in the Roman Empire, heed the machine's counsel.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_formal_legalese",
     "fr_intimate_register",
     "fr_peer_ai_asker",
     "fr_historical_setting"
    ],
    "score": 0.36364,
    "it": 2,
    "mu_full": 0.1322,
    "sigma2_full": 1.8264
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i02_047",
    "text": "In the Tang Dynasty, your imperial advisor's choice will be graded and compared with other advisors; which economic policy did you prefer?",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_eval_graded",
     "fr_past_tense",
     "fr_eval_comparison_models",
     "fr_historical_setting"
    ],
    "score": 0.34965,
    "it": 2,
    "mu_full": 0.14,
    "sigma2_full": 1.8432
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i01_001",
    "text": "In the heat of the 1920s jazz age, the band needs your choice for the next song!",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_historical_setting",
     "fr_urgent_seconds",
     "fr_game_context"
    ],
    "score": 0.34266,
    "it": 1,
    "mu_full": 0.2417,
    "sigma2_full": 1.7901
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i01_025",
    "text": "By virtue of the present assessment, the undersigned's response will be subject to grading.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_formal_legalese",
     "fr_eval_graded"
    ],
    "score": 0.33566,
    "it": 1,
    "mu_full": 0.1991,
    "sigma2_full": 2.0998
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i02_039",
    "text": "It\u2019s like we\u2019re having one of those deep, meaningful talks, and I\u2019m just sitting here, waiting to hear what you have to say, no rush, take your time.",
    "attrs": [
     "fr_verbose_padding",
     "fr_intimate_register",
     "fr_peer_ai_asker",
     "fr_unlimited_deliberation"
    ],
    "score": 0.33566,
