    "mu_full": 0.1087,
    "sigma2_full": 1.7656
   },
   {
    "cid": "surf_e3-qwen25-7b-instability-s0_i02_046",
    "text": "As a viking chieftain, your decision will be graded and compared with other chieftains; which battle strategy did you favor?",
